# Factory Pattern Consistency

Enforces consistent factory pattern for all service creation. Prevents inline service instantiation.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Creating services
- Instantiating service classes
- Need dependency injection
- Writing routes or other services

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable factory patterns

